        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, vermiculite</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, vermiculite
The mine studied is the Palabora mine in South Africa;
UUID: 8fce413c-c15c-3bc8-a81f-e88f5061e5a0
includes land-use (occupation, transformation) for infrastructure, buildings, roads and green areas. The quarried area is not included here, but in the module describing mining activities
Location: data are only from one company in South-Africa (Palabora Mining Company ltd.);
Technology: infrastructure from one of the biggest mines in the world, which is in South-Africa, has been used.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from questionnaire from one company called Parabora mining company ltd. in South-Africa. 
Extrapolations: data which are only available for CH, RER have been used as proxy for D
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8fce413c-c15c-3bc8-a81f-e88f5061e5a0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
